            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_id53dcfd27">
               <p xml:id="idm76">The present short pamphlet was issued in Hamburg in 1738 and refers to the the dispute between Scheibe and <persName xml:id="idm77" auth.uri="http://www.viaf.org" auth="VIAF" role="">Johann Abraham Birnbaum</persName> regarding <persName xml:id="idm78" auth.uri="http://www.viaf.org" auth="VIAF" role="">Johann Sebastian Bach</persName>. The pamphlet is Scheibe's response to Birnbaum's critique. It was later included in the second edition of <rend xml:id="idm79" fontstyle="italic">Der Critische Musicus</rend> (1745; SchW C1:008).</p>
            </history>
            <langUsage xml:id="langUsage_fd7b87c3">
               <language xml:id="en">English</language>
               <language xml:id="de">German</language>
            </langUsage>
